WEBVTT

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.256
I don't have to tell you
that you can't live on that.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.736
With savings down,

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:39.616
pensions becoming a relic of the past

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:43.616
and 401(k) plans
failing millions of Americans,

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:47.176
many near-retirees
are dependent on social security

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.240
as their retirement plan.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.096
But here's the problem.

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:55.616
Social security was never supposed
to be the retirement plan.

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:56.896
It's not nearly enough.

00:08:56.920 --> 00:08:59.856
At best it replaces
something like 40 percent

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:01.840
of your pre-retirement income.